# ============================================================================
# Cloudflare Pages / Workers static-assets _headers
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
# (Same syntax works for the [assets] block in a Worker deployment.)
#
# The Content-Security-Policy below is the piece that matters most for this
# project: without an explicit `frame-src` allowance, modern browsers block
# game iframes on game.html by default. Domains are scoped to exactly what
# each feed serves today (verified against the live feeds / official docs
# while building this project):
#   - GameMonetize embeds -> html5.gamemonetize.co   thumbnails -> img.gamemonetize.com
#   - GamePix embeds      -> play.gamepix.com         thumbnails -> img.gamepix.com
#   - our own games (games/kicau-mania/…) -> 'self'
# A wildcard subdomain is included per host family as a safety net in case a
# future catalog entry uses a different subdomain.
# ============================================================================

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: interest-cohort=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://cdn.tailwindcss.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' https: data:; connect-src 'self'; frame-src 'self' https://html5.gamemonetize.co https://*.gamemonetize.co https://gamemonetize.com https://*.gamemonetize.com https://play.gamepix.com https://*.gamepix.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self'
